# Terraform
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
plan

# Backups and variants of the tfvars. `*.tfvars` alone does NOT match
# terraform.tfvars.bak or terraform.tfvars.1 — and those hold the same
# credentials as the original.
*.tfvars.*
*.tfvars.bak*

# ...except the committed template, which holds only REPLACE_ME.
# A negation must come AFTER the pattern it exempts.
!terraform.tfvars.example
